# 7. MARGIN CALCULATION

Do not calculate misleading margins.

For normal delivered orders:

`Margin % = Net Cash Profit / Settlement × 100`

Only display margin when the denominator makes sense.

If:

Settlement <= 0

display:

`—`

instead of producing strange percentages such as 115%.

For missing cost:

Margin = `—`

For cancelled orders requiring review:

