# 26. IMPORTANT FINANCIAL PRINCIPLE

The application must clearly distinguish:

### CASH PROFIT

"What cash did I actually make after paying the supplier?"

`Settlement - Purchase Cost Incl GST - Ad Cost`

and:

### GST / ACCOUNTING PROFIT

"What is the business profit after separating GST and eligible input tax credit?"

These are different views.

Never subtract input GST from cash profit a second time.

